# prose-audit: Grade A — The historical Mentzen succession and a conditioned Korwin counter-coup are both grounded in named organisations, Lewica's prior choices and bespoke aftermaths.
title: The libertarian machine chooses its public face
face-image: img/poland/events/pres-candidate-mentzen.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.konf_succession_2022_done = 1;
Q.wolnosciowcy_formed = 1;
Q.wolnosciowcy_leader = "Artur Dziambor";
Q.wolnosciowcy_mps = 3;
Q.wolnosciowcy_seats = 0;
Q.wolnosciowcy_status =
    "Autonomous libertarian party inside Konfederacja's parliamentary circle";
const restrainedAntiSystemRecruitment =
    [
        "Restrictions with a social shield",
        "National unity"
    ].includes(String(Q.covid_policy || "")) &&
    [
        "Public-health mobilisation",
        "Local access"
    ].includes(String(Q.vaccination_strategy || "")) &&
    (Number(Q.konf_mentzenite_share) || 0) <= 47 &&
    (Number(Q.anti_establishment_youth_konf_affinity) || 0) <= 4;
Q.konf_korwin_countercoup_2022 =
    restrainedAntiSystemRecruitment ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.konf_korwin_countercoup_2022) {
    const rumpSeats = Math.min(
        3,
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0)
    );
    Q.konf_leader = "Korwin–Bosak–Braun";
    Q.konf_libertarian_outgoing_leader =
        "Sławomir Mentzen — congress result overturned";
    Q.konf_libertarian_leader = "Janusz Korwin-Mikke";
    Q.konf_org_resources = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.konf_org_resources) || 0) - 1
    );
    Q.konf_mentzenite_share = Math.max(
        8,
        (Number(Q.konf_mentzenite_share) || 47) - 24
    );
    Q.konf_braunist_share += 8;
    Q.konf_nationalist_share += 8;
    Q.konf_poll_momentum -= 0.2;
    Q.konf_seats -= rumpSeats;
    Q.other_seats += rumpSeats;
    Q.wolnosciowcy_leader =
        "Artur Dziambor and Sławomir Mentzen";
    Q.wolnosciowcy_seats = rumpSeats;
    Q.wolnosciowcy_status =
        "Independent radical-libertarian rump outside Konfederacja";
    Q.wolnosciowcy_poll_momentum = 0.35;
    Q.other_poll_momentum += 0.2;
    Q.february_2023_konf_done = 1;
    Q.far_right_agenda += 2;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Korwin expels Mentzen and Wolnościowcy becomes a radical-libertarian rump";
} else {
    Q.konf_leader = "Mentzen–Bosak–Braun";
    Q.konf_libertarian_outgoing_leader = "Janusz Korwin-Mikke";
    Q.konf_libertarian_leader = "Sławomir Mentzen";
    Q.konf_org_resources =
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_org_resources) || 0) + 2;
    Q.konf_economic_position = Math.min(
        100,
        (Number(Q.konf_economic_position) || 86) + 3
    );
    Q.konf_poll_momentum =
        (Number(Q.konf_poll_momentum) || 0) + 0.35;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Mentzen replaces Korwin and repackages the libertarian right";
}
!}

= October 2022 — Discipline or schism

The KORWiN congress is meant to transfer its presidency from **Janusz
Korwin-Mikke** to his vice-chair, <span class="party-konf"><b>Sławomir Mentzen</b></span>. It cannot transfer
Konfederacja itself: **Krzysztof Bosak's** nationalists and **Grzegorz Braun's**
clerical radicals remain separate power centres. **Artur Dziambor, Jakub
Kulesza and Dobromir Sośnierz** have already left KORWiN to create
Wolnościowcy, although their three MPs still sit inside the federation's
parliamentary circle.

[? if not konf_korwin_countercoup_2022: Korwin honours the congress result.
Mentzen inherits the party machine with younger tax campaigners, digital
organisers and the founder's public blessing. He offers the same radical
economic programme with fewer improvised scandals and a better camera angle.?]

[? if konf_korwin_countercoup_2022: Mentzen wins the congress, but Korwin's
loyalists refuse the handover. Our earlier social-shield and vaccination work
has denied the younger machine the anti-system recruitment surge it expected;
the founder believes he can survive without it. Korwin expels Mentzen and
retakes KORWiN. Mentzen joins Dziambor's Wolnościowcy, and its three MPs leave
Konfederacja as an independent radical-libertarian rump. Bosak and Braun gain
weight inside a smaller, less disciplined federation.?]

For us, the danger is not a colourful quotation. [? if not
konf_korwin_countercoup_2022: Mentzen can make welfare retrenchment look young,
professional and anti-system.?][? if konf_korwin_countercoup_2022: Korwin and
Mentzen now compete to make the same retrenchment sound more uncompromising.?]
Both routes target renters and precarious workers whom we have failed to
organise.

