Our candidates put a closed clinic, a higher rent and a lost bus route beside
every promise to abolish a tax. [? if konf_korwin_countercoup_2022: The split
right must now answer the same bill from two podiums.?][? if not
konf_korwin_countercoup_2022: Mentzen keeps his reach, but loses the luxury of
presenting cuts as a cost-free rebellion.?]

